      "booking_link_quote": null,
      "status": "unclear",
      "note": "Validator host check fails because the PDF sits on the site's Webflow CDN, not papisapi.com — left unclear for the acceptor. Official menu (page + PDF) lists no named cuts: 'wagyu rib eye' and 'picanha' are not on it and cuts are sold from the showcase by portion/weight. 'without cliff-club prices' is an unsupported comparison and was dropped. Dinner-only (opens 4 pm) and Labuan Sait are supported by the home page. Menu PDF is the 'download our menu' link on papisapi.com/menu-bali; it is hosted on the site's Webflow CDN (cdn.prod.website-files.com), so the validator flags the host — first-party file linked from the official page.",
      "category": "restaurant"
    },
